# and On Sabbatical completed and Downward Helix accepted at Prog 0 (GMs; On Sabbatical's Timer 0). A zone-in answers
# with a bare csid, so the first container with one wins, in the order the trace records: the missions, then the
# quests (downward_helix#zonein plays the quest rivals). Southern San d'Oria [S] from East Ronfaure [S] with the WotG
# mission Cait Sith current: its 67, finished: Cait Sith complete; again: Downward Helix's 65, finished: Prog 1.
# Ganged Up On (the Rhapsodies mission 2-16) current and Prog 0 again (GMs): its 185, finished; again: 65, finished:
